## 5. The Detector checklist (copy into `03b_audit.md`)

```
[ ] Every requirement in 00_brief maps to >= 1 task          (loophole)
[ ] Every task has acceptance criteria + a test               (loophole)
[ ] Every wireframe state has data/API behind it              (loophole)
[ ] Every API/contract is used by some UI or job              (hustle: dead work)
[ ] No file appears in two tasks of the same wave             (conflict)
[ ] Contracts agree between BE and FE                         (conflict)
[ ] Every task reuses 01_discovery items where possible       (hustle)
[ ] No L-size task, no dependency cycle                       (hustle)
[ ] Auth / permission / secrets / cost loops reviewed         (risk)
[ ] Migrations are new files, never edit applied ones         (risk)
VERDICT: PASS | CHANGES (list)
```

